      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-04-24T19:37:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Do they not provide a free text field where you can write what you want? Does it take more than a sentence to write why you haven't bought the app?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It's a single-line text field, not a text block. &nbsp;It's not a huge deal obviously, but you wouldn't expect people to write much of an explanation in a small field like that. &nbsp;I would imagine you'd get more \"didn't get it because it's not fun\" answers rather than \"here's why I think it's not fun\" explanations.</p>\n<p>Sounds like they're getting what they wanted, so it's no big deal.</p>",
